        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swing and launch yourself into the sky!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SwingJump</strong> is a simple physics-based action game where you challenge yourself to see how far you can launch from a swing.<br>Add power with the right timing, get into a rhythm, manage your stamina, and aim for the perfect jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with satisfying physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the acceleration as you pump the swing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, pick-up-and-play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic stamina management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze your jump distance and trajectory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sound effects and music used in this game were provided by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effect Lab </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOVA-SYNDROME </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to the creators for making these great resources available.</p>",
